G04 ================================================== *
G04 Macro Definition: Parameterized 3-Spoke (Segment)  *
G04                   Thermal Relief Pad               *
G04 Variables:                                         *
G04   $1 = Diameter                                    *
G04   $2 = Total Air Gap (e.g. start with 2mm)         *
G04   $3 = Spoke Angle Offset (started with 0°)        *
G04 Parameters: D=2.00mm, TotalGap=2mm, Offset=0       *
G04 ================================================== *
%AMTHM_3SEG*
$4=$2/3*
$5=$1-0.01*
$3=$3+0*
1,1,$1,0,0*
1,0,$5,0,0*
20,0,$4,0,0,0,$5,$3+1X360/3*
20,0,$4,0,0,0,$5,$3+2X360/3*
20,0,$4,0,0,0,$5,$3+3X360/3*%
G04 ================================================== *
G04 Macro Definition: Parameterized 4-Spoke (Segment)  *
G04                   Thermal Relief Pad               *
G04 Variables:                                         *
G04   $1 = Diameter                                    *
G04   $2 = Total Air Gap (e.g. start with 2mm)         *
G04   $3 = Spoke Angle Offset (started with 45°)       *
G04 Parameters: D=2.00mm, TotalGap=2mm, Offset=0       *
G04 ================================================== *
%AMTHM_4SEG*
$4=$2/3*
$5=$1-0.01*
$3=$3+45*
1,1,$1,0,0*
1,0,$5,0,0*
20,0,$4,0,0,0,$5,$3+1X360/4*
20,0,$4,0,0,0,$5,$3+2X360/4*
20,0,$4,0,0,0,$5,$3+3X360/4*
20,0,$4,0,0,0,$5,$3+4X360/4*%
G04 ================================================== *
G04 Macro Definition: Parameterized Corner-Gapped Pad  *
G04 Variables:                                         *
G04 $1 = Outer Width                                   *
G04 $2 = Outer Height                                  *
G04 $3 = Diagonal Air Gap (e.g. start with 0.5mm)      *
G04 ================================================== *
%AMTHM_RECT*
$4=$3X0.707107*
$5=$1X0.5*
$6=$2X0.5*
$7=$5-$4*
$8=$6-$4*
20,1,0.01,-$7,$6,$7,$6,0*
20,1,0.01,-$7,-$6,$7,-$6,0*
20,1,0.01,-$5,-$8,-$5,$8,0*
20,1,0.01,$5,-$8,$5,$8,0*%
G04 ================================================== *
